  "description": "A long climb from the village of Shybene, at about 850 m, to Pip Ivan Chornohirskyi (2,028 m) in the Chornohora range — 11 km and 1,180 m of ascent. The first 700 m are on a minor road, then a track and path take over; OpenStreetMap rates the trail as mountain hiking (SAC T2). Along the way a spring and camp spots are mapped near Maricheyka (1,510 m) and further up. Plan a full day.\n\nRoute data © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). OSM relation/10355026.\nCover photo: Tetiana.iefimenko / CC BY 4.0 / Wikimedia Commons.",
